      "updated": 1793890663906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agentic AI System with LangGraph\n\n- Simple chatbat workflow\n- Persistance in the langGraph\n- Add Streaming\n- Resume chatbot\n- Database intergration\n- Chatbot UI\n- Tools in the langGraph\n- Observability - langsmith\n- RAG \n- HITL (Human-in-the-loop)\n- Evaluation\n- Deployment (CI/CD) + AWS EC2\n",
      "fontSize": 45.822309751727914,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agentic AI System with LangGraph\n\n- Simple chatbat workflow\n- Persistance in the langGraph\n- Add Streaming\n- Resume chatbot\n- Database intergration\n- Chatbot UI\n- Tools in the langGraph\n- Observability - langsmith\n- RAG \n- HITL (Human-in-the-loop)\n- Evaluation\n- Deployment (CI/CD) + AWS EC2\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3s",
      "autoResize": true
    },
